flowchart LR
  actor["Contributor or agent"]:::person
  workflow["Workflow skill<br/>[Routing owner]"]:::component
  authors["Authoring skills<br/>[Governed content + authoring transition]"]:::component
  reviewers["Review peers<br/>[Review evidence + matching settlement]"]:::component
  downstream["Downstream stages<br/>[Implementation or stage evidence]"]:::component
  artifacts["Governed artifacts<br/>[Stable Markdown intent]"]:::container
  evidence["Stage-owned evidence<br/>[Markdown review, resolution, proof, and learn records]"]:::container
  validators["Lifecycle and skill validators<br/>[Repository-owned scripts]"]:::component
  adapters["Generated public adapters<br/>[Derived skill guidance]"]:::container

  subgraph change["Change-local lifecycle state<br/>[YAML: docs/changes/&lt;change-id&gt;/change.yaml]"]
    artifact_states["artifact_states<br/>[Transition-scoped lifecycle entries]"]:::component
    workflow_state["workflow_state<br/>[Routing, planned work, blocker, closeout]"]:::component
    target["automation target<br/>[Repository-local stopping point]"]:::component
    links["evidence links<br/>[Paths, not duplicated evidence bodies]"]:::component
  end

  actor -->|selects one repository-local target through| workflow
  workflow -->|records and reads| target
  workflow -->|updates routing only in| workflow_state
  workflow -->|invokes the current owner after prerequisite validation| authors
  workflow -->|invokes matching peer review after authoring completes| reviewers
  workflow -->|invokes basis-complete downstream work through| downstream

  authors -->|write only owned content in| artifacts
  authors -->|write authoring evidence and matching authoring transition in| artifact_states
  reviewers -->|read without editing| artifacts
  reviewers -->|write formal review evidence in| evidence
  reviewers -->|settle only the matching entry in| artifact_states
  downstream -->|read without editing| artifacts
  downstream -->|write implementation or stage evidence in| evidence
  downstream -->|route upstream defects through| workflow

  artifact_states -->|link current authoring or review evidence through| links
  workflow_state -->|links current blocker and completion evidence through| links
  links -->|resolve to| evidence
  validators -->|reject unknown values, illegal transitions, stale evidence, cross-owner transition claims, and open blockers in| change
  authors -->|define fixed stage boundaries copied into| adapters
  reviewers -->|define peer-review boundaries copied into| adapters
  workflow -->|defines routing-only behavior copied into| adapters
  validators -->|prove published ownership and generated parity for| adapters

  classDef person fill:#08427b,stroke:#073b6f,color:#fff
  classDef system fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0e5aa7,color:#fff
  classDef external fill:#999,stroke:#666,color:#fff
  classDef container fill:#438dd5,stroke:#3c7fc0,color:#fff
  classDef component fill:#85bbf0,stroke:#3c7fc0,color:#111
